---
title: Referrals
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /referrals/
wide: true
description: Referral codes for the services I actually pay for and use. Both of us get something when you sign up.
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6">

  <div class="border-b border-line dark:border-stone-800 pb-4">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Referrals</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
      Codes for services I pay for and use. Sign up through one of these and we both get
      something, usually credit or money off. I get nothing if you do not stay, so there is
      nothing here I would not recommend anyway.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
    {% for item in referrals.items %}
      {% if item.url %}
        <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="ticket" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" data-track="referral_click">
          <div class="ticket-body">
            {% if item.category %}<p class="ticket-category">{{ item.category }}</p>{% endif %}
            <h2 class="ticket-name">{{ item.name }}</h2>
            {% if item.description %}<p class="ticket-description">{{ item.description }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if item.benefit %}<p class="ticket-benefit">{{ item.benefit }}</p>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="ticket-stub">
            <p class="ticket-stub-label">{% if item.code %}Code{% else %}Redeem{% endif %}</p>
            <p class="ticket-code">{% if item.code %}{{ item.code }}{% else %}&rarr;{% endif %}</p>
            <span class="ticket-barcode" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

</div>
